WEBVTT

00:00:00.077 --> 00:00:02.687
Browser agents and desktop
scrapers are fragmented.

00:00:03.058 --> 00:00:04.508
Danikuse unifies them.

00:00:04.610 --> 00:00:06.880
A light automation
browser for daily tasks,

00:00:07.130 --> 00:00:10.000
and your personal Brave
attached with no debug port.

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:12.260
Confirm Mode asks before mutating.

00:00:12.416 --> 00:00:15.106
Payments and passwords
hit an instant Hard Stop.

00:00:15.277 --> 00:00:18.447
Every action returns one
verifiable JSON contract.

00:00:18.718 --> 00:00:20.088
No evidence, no done.

00:00:20.277 --> 00:00:21.327
Install with PowerShell.

00:00:21.703 --> 00:00:22.953
Apache two on GitHub.

